sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Page
    participant Server
    participant data.json

    User->>Page: 1. Open Website
    Note right of User: https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/notes
    Page-->>User: Loading The Page

    User->>Page: 2. Write something into the text field

    User->>Page: 3. Click the Save button
    Note right of User: Form element

    Page->>Server: Send to Server
    Note right of Page: HTTP POST request (new_note)

    Server->>data.json: Save to Array
    Note right of Server: content, date

    data.json-->>Server: Load from Array

    Server-->>Page: Load from Server
    Note right of Page: HTTP GET requests <br> (notes, main.css, main.js, data.json)
    
    Page-->>User: Refreshing and update with new note
